---
import ContentPage from "@/components/ContentPage.astro";
---

<ContentPage pageKey="cookie-policy">
  <section>
    <h2>Adsterra preferences</h2>
    <p>When Adsterra advertising is enabled, eligible placements load automatically subject to your saved preference and Global Privacy Control. The “Adsterra ad preferences” checkbox near the footer lets you opt out without changing Google analytics settings. The preference is stored in <code>magic-sort-adsterra-consent-v1</code> until changed or cleared. Existing explicit refusals are preserved; unavailable or unreadable storage leaves scripts off.</p>
    <p>Changing the preference reloads the page. Opting out prevents further Adsterra script loads; use browser settings to remove cookies already stored by advertising providers. See the <a href="/privacy-policy/#adsterra-privacy">Adsterra privacy details</a>. Sponsored external links open only when you click them.</p>
  </section>
</ContentPage>
